  "prefLabel": "Eng 103.01 Duties and Responsibilities",
  "priorExpiration": "1998-09-17",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Eng 103.01 Duties and Responsibilities. The board shall administer the provisions of RSA 310-A:2-27 which include but are not limited to safeguarding life, health, and property, to promoting public welfare and maintaining a high standard of integrity regarding the practice of professional engineering in this state.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Eng 100) #5397, eff 5-20-92; ss by #6752, Interim, eff 5-20-98, EXPIRED: 9-17-98\n\nNew. #6910, eff 12-15-98",
